#: ../../tools/pathwaycommons_tools.rst:32 ac4864f0cf984dcdac11cc6de39d457b
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get the interaction neighborhood for a gene from Pathway"
" Commons. Returns all known interactions (protein-protein, regulatory, "
"catalytic, complex membership) for the query gene from 22 integrated "
"databases. Each interaction includes the partner gene, interaction type "
"(interacts-with, controls-state-change-of, controls-expression-of, in-"
"complex-with, etc.), data source, and PubMed references. Useful for "
"building gene interaction networks and finding functional partners."
msgstr ""

