msgid "**Name**: ``PathwayCommons_search``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pathwaycommons_tools.rst:103 414fa54d1d36418887238028f76748e3
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search Pathway Commons for pathways, interactions, and "
"molecular entities across 22 integrated databases (Reactome, KEGG, "
"WikiPathways, PID, BioGRID, IntAct, HPRD, etc.). Search by gene symbol, "
"protein name, or keyword. Optionally filter by BioPAX entity type "
"(Pathway, Protein, SmallMolecule, Complex) and data source. Returns "
"pathway URIs, names, data sources, and participant/process counts. Use "
"PathwayCommons\\_get\\_pathway with returned URI for full pathway "
"details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pathwaycommons_tools.rst:107 ff1dfdc977e343329afeebe4126ccfd9
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search query: gene symbol (BRCA1, TP53), "
"protein name, pathway name, or keyword"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pathwaycommons_tools.rst:110 1c3832dd6aa5486588f7cbfad2d64fdf
msgid ""
"``type`` (string, null) (optional) BioPAX entity type filter (default: "
"all types)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pathwaycommons_tools.rst:113 cf03fecef1104d18929d9e69153d32ff
msgid ""
"``datasource`` (string, null) (optional) Data source filter: reactome, "
"kegg, wikipathways, pid, biogrid, intact, hprd, panther, netpath, corum, "
"ctd, drugbank, msigdb, mirtarbase"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pathwaycommons_tools.rst:116 20abeea10611423aa649add0466a8926
msgid ""
"``organism`` (string, null) (optional) Organism filter: taxonomy ID (9606"
" for human, 10090 for mouse) or organism name"
msgstr ""

